  "importFindings": [
    "Dashboard.view statically imported the dashboard barrel, which mounted the QuickNotes form while closed.",
    "ShiftReportModal and exportToPdf were also imported for a closed report viewer.",
    "The vendor chunk combined Query persistence, Table/Virtual cores, Workbox and Form dependencies.",
    "Separating Form alone was insufficient: Table/Virtual in vendor imported Store from Form and pulled the whole group into boot.",
    "Grouping the full Query family and Table/Virtual separately breaks that edge; Form and sanitization stay optional.",
    "AmbientReminderManager still loads notes independently; socket/store unread notifications remain active."
  ]
